# The files scripts/build-tree.mjs generates are written with LF and compared byte for byte by
# `--check`. Keep them LF in every checkout, so a merge on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) does not
# rewrite them with CRLF and raise a false "stale" alarm. The notes themselves are not pinned.
tree/** text eol=lf
"social-pin/Card Index.md" text eol=lf
"social-pin/tasks/Task Board.md" text eol=lf
social-pin/tasks/Backlog.md text eol=lf
